WEBVTT

00:07:59.975 --> 00:08:01.761
"If you want to get away from it all

00:08:01.761 --> 00:08:03.375
and see something you've never seen,

00:08:03.375 --> 00:08:06.960
or have an excellent chance of seeing something that no one's ever seen,

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.490
get in a sub."

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:10.696
He should have been with us for this adventure.

00:08:10.696 --> 00:08:12.503
We miss him.

00:08:12.503 --> 00:08:17.719
(Applause)